    question: 'Can I access my passwords offline?',
    answer: '<p>Yes, all major password managers cache an encrypted copy of your vault locally. You can access passwords without internet—essential for travelers or areas with spotty connectivity.</p><p>The vault syncs automatically when you\'re back online. Some managers (like 1Password) let you control which vaults are stored locally for extra security.</p>'
  },
